From: "togetherweown[bot]" <togetherweown[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 15:42:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat(heartbeat): call run model decision hook before
 adapter config merge

executeRun asks the run.model.resolve holder for the run's model after the
issue override parse and before the adapter config merge. A decide answer is
applied run-scoped to the merged config (before secret resolution) and to the
native Paperclip Runner provider input. The outcome is recorded on
contextSnapshot.modelDecision and carried by later run lifecycle events.

With requireRunModelDecision on, no decision parks the run as a bounded
model_decision_pending resource wait (own attempt counter, no failure budget,
no legacy reconciliation) and surfaces the issue once attempts run out; the
run never starts on the default model. A failed holder lookup parks rather
than skips. With the flag off the hook is advisory only.

Refs: TOG-11792
